        "description": "Steele Sloan Designs is the home of officially licensed collegiate jewelry for fans across the country. From Auburn and Alabama to Ole Miss, LSU, Arkansas, and beyond, every collection is made in tarnish-resistant, hypoallergenic stainless steel.\n<br><br>\nWhether you're shopping for yourself, hunting for the perfect graduation gift, or putting together a game day look, there's a piece here for every fan on your list.",
